<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first</p>
<p>day of four-day English County Championship cricket matches on</p>
<p>Wednesday:</p>
<p>At Portsmouth: Middlesex 199 in 60 overs (K.Brown 57;</p>
<p>L.Botham 5-67). Hampshire 105-4.</p>
<p>At Chester-le-Street: Glamorgan 73-3 v Durham.</p>
